flowchart LR
    public[Public visitors] --> global[Public DNS<br/>apex → download → Yandex host]
    local[Local visitors<br/>Repository CA trusted] --> dc1[dc1 DNS<br/>download → apex → local address]

    subgraph cloud[Yandex Cloud]
        ct[Traefik · TCP 80/443<br/>Let's Encrypt HTTP-01] --> cn[Nginx · read only<br/>127.0.0.1:8008]
        cn --> cd[(100 GiB Btrfs<br/>/srv/download<br/>Retained across VM replacement)]
        ct --- ca[System disk · /opt/traefik<br/>Private ACME state]
    end
    subgraph onprem[XCP-ng]
        lt[Traefik · TCP 80/443<br/>Vault ACME HTTP-01 + EAB] --> ln[Nginx · read only<br/>127.0.0.1:8008]
        ln --> ld[(100 GiB Btrfs<br/>/srv/download<br/>VM replacement blocked)]
        lt --- la[System disk · /opt/traefik<br/>Private ACME state]
    end

    global --> ct
    dc1 --> lt
    publisher[Operator · choose local or yandex<br/>SSH administrator → sudo as download]
    publisher -->|rsync + release selection| cd
    publisher -->|rsync + release selection| ld
